<view class="page"><view class="heading"><view><view class="title">成员与权限</view><view class="note">三年级 2 班 · 机构内别名与席位管理</view></view><button bindtap="createInvite"><t-icon name="qrcode" size="34rpx" />邀请</button></view><view wx:if="{{inviteOpen}}" class="invite"><view class="qr"><t-icon name="qrcode" size="150rpx" color="#174E2A" /></view><view><view>家长扫码后确认孩子与披露范围</view><text>72 小时内有效 · 入组仍需教师审批</text></view></view><view class="section"><view class="section__title">待审批入组 <text>{{pending.length}}</text></view><view wx:for="{{pending}}" wx:key="id" class="request"><view><view>{{item.name}}</view><text>{{item.guardian}}</text></view><button bindtap="approve">批准</button></view></view><view class="section"><view class="section__title">待认领学生席位</view><view wx:for="{{seats}}" wx:key="code" class="seat"><t-icon name="user-unknown" size="42rpx" color="#174E2A" /><view><view>名册号 {{item.code}}</view><text>{{item.status}}</text></view><button>查看认领码</button></view></view><view class="section"><view class="section__title">教师与助教</view><view class="staff"><view><view>语文李老师</view><text>教师 · 可发布和审核</text></view><t-icon name="chevron-right" size="32rpx" /></view><view class="staff"><view><view>陈助教</view><text>助教 · 可审核，不可配置成员权限</text></view><t-icon name="chevron-right" size="32rpx" /></view></view></view>
